<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<title>Type3arabi — third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  body { font: 14px/1.5 "Segoe UI", sans-serif; max-width: 960px; margin: 32px auto; padding: 0 16px; color: #0F1F3D; }
  h1 { font-size: 22px; } h2 { font-size: 16px; margin-top: 28px; }
  ul.used { columns: 2; } pre { white-space: pre-wrap; background: #F5F8FF; padding: 12px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 12px; }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Type3arabi — third-party licenses</h1>
<p>Open-source Rust crates compiled into the Type3arabi binaries (keyboard DLL, hotkey companion, Settings app),
generated by <code>cargo about</code>. Type3arabi itself is Apache-2.0; the language model's license and data
attributions are in NOTICE.md and DATASETS.md.</p>
<h2>Licenses used</h2>
<ul class="used">
{{#each overview}}<li>{{name}} ({{count}})</li>
{{/each}}</ul>
{{#each licenses}}
<h2 id="{{id}}">{{name}}</h2>
<p>Used by:</p>
<ul class="used">{{#each used_by}}<li>{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</li>{{/each}}</ul>
<pre>{{text}}</pre>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
